{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f3ad708ee250fef31384ea03c69be7d08569300936d58d2fa0596cbdb1ea881b","ja":"アイドルとして","zh":"身为偶像","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"90f555c3c67eb1539a25453ea4e1481064c0e9dbd11ecd89792a75baaf15fd93","ja":"堂々とって言われても……参加してるのは\nすごい人たちばっかりみたいだし、大丈夫かな……？","zh":"就算让我堂堂正正地去……但参加的好像\n净是些厉害的人，真的没问题吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2ddfedb8611ceedeaf4a12960b62d4a684fbca9f7e367f2867b304018e80cd32","ja":"そうですね……\n変に目立ってしまうような気もします。","zh":"确实呢……\n感觉反而会显得很扎眼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8ee3d9e207d951e4fd18852554ba7c8160725d4206177699db6964d9547e9e10","ja":"なに言ってるの！　たしかにすごい人がいるかも\nしれないけど、みんなだって負けてないわよ！","zh":"在说什么呢！虽然可能确实有人很厉害，\n但大家也绝对不会输的呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"de035c1383916d61ef0d6c04fc819093ba35c4c3fbb68dfa19dc667833954bc2","ja":"わ、私たちが社長さんとか有名人にですか……！？","zh":"我、我们要去见社长和名人吗……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"493d1541da477eac6cd730f0c73b1366e7474c9feb6b1bb46ebab111e2d50e43","ja":"ええ。だって私は、みんなが\nアイドルとして輝いてるところを見てるもの。","zh":"嗯。毕竟我一直看着大家\n作为偶像闪闪发光的样子呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"15d616e5b7c0465e08088516f4c83f524d3f3520e2e505a5a8f287b5df792bca","ja":"私たちはアイドルなんだから、このパーティーでも、\n参加者みんなに、その輝きを見せればいいのよ！","zh":"我们可是偶像，所以在这个派对上，\n只要让所有参加者都看到这份光彩就行了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"584e546803627b7a2232233ac3d9e4c56b7c097224de2800e6c8373444cb3222","ja":"た、たしかに！　アイドルちゃんの輝きは、\nどんなに偉い人にだって負けてないですよね！","zh":"确、确实是这样！偶像们的光芒，\n可完全不输给任何了不起的大人物呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"405a6bcfae57978c1c23749fb4c42670af21e2805c7f61e7e0bbf4d04b04a8a0","ja":"それなら……ここが映画のセットで、\nアイドルとして役を演じるって考えたらどうですか！？","zh":"那样的话……把这里当成电影拍摄布景，\n想象成自己是作为偶像在演戏，你觉得怎么样！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"be4e559bd80feaee5eaa5b0202dd0abab675164b13141d32d9a8c83cef586238","ja":"そっか……映画の役、公爵や王子や令嬢なら、\nこのパーティーにふさわしくなるよね！","zh":"这样啊……要是电影里的角色是公爵、王子或者千金小姐，\n就很适合这场派对了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1369.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"6abb60414c4d799f2f632082cdf6556c3ae5a766470c27e9ca52299500e60a1a","ja":"よーしっ！　せっかく来たんだし、アイドルとして、\nみんなでこの舞台を楽しんでみようよ！","zh":"好～嘞！难得来一次，作为偶像，\n大家一起好好享受这个舞台吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
